    "Natural nonvisual storm strikes and native positive polarization rolls are existential sources, not observed storms or a finite weather/yield guarantee. Credit only one magnet from one alloy; ignore the native inclusive-loop excess-output branch.",
    "TFC native soil, current gathered barley and paper feed a fresh balanced composter. Wait beyond its climate-adjusted calendar period and collect one new compost per cycle. No old compost or biomass is seeded.",
